cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "derivflow: option pricing and risk in Python"
abstract: >-
  A Python library for European and American option pricing, Greeks, implied volatility,
  Monte Carlo with variance reduction, barrier and Asian options, the Heston model,
  volatility surfaces and portfolio VaR, with results cross-checked against QuantLib,
  py_vollib and published reference values.
authors:
